      "blocks": {
        "item_rqhXk8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/The_Benefits_Of_Cacao_1.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Antioxidant Powerhouse, Nature’s Shield",
            "content": "<p>Think of cacao as your body’s personal bouncer, kicking out free radicals before they can crash the health party. Packed with antioxidants, cacao’s powerful flavonoids go to work defending your cells against premature aging and disease.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_m7CrKT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/The_Benefits_Of_Cacao_2.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Natural Mood Booster",
            "content": "<p>When life needs a little brightness, cacao steps in as the ultimate feel-good agent. It’s rich in compounds that encourage serotonin, dopamine, and endorphins—turning every bite into a mini happiness boost. Forget sugar highs and crashes; with cacao, you’re getting a natural lift that’s as steady as it is delicious.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_cL8Jd8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/The_Benefits_Of_Cacao_3.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Nutritional Powerhouse",
            "content": "<p>Cacao may come in a humble bean, but it’s packed with essentials like magnesium, iron, and fiber. This is no empty treat; it’s full-on nourishment, giving you minerals that are essential for muscles, mood, and energy. In short, cacao is as nourishing as it is flavorful.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_KAU3Wz": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/The_Benefits_Of_Cacao_4.jpg",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Naturally Energizing",
            "content": "<p>Need energy but tired of the caffeine spikes? Cacao has theobromine, a gentle stimulant that offers sustained energy without the jitters. It’s a natural lift that keeps you focused and ready for anything, making cacao a perfect pick-me-up any time of the day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_NGNqGj": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/The_Benefits_Of_Cacao_5.jpg",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Heart Health Hero",
            "content": "<p>With a heart as golden as its flavor, cacao supports cardiovascular health with a special dose of love. High in flavonoids, it helps improve blood flow and reduces blood pressure, giving your heart the boost it deserves. It's like a little cardio session you can savor.</p>"
          }
        }
