        "subheading": "",
        "title": "We don't cut corners.",
        "content": "<p>We set out to build a chocolate brand you can trust, all the way through. From our farmers to our ingredients, to our packaging, we are intentional in making sure sustainability and ethics lie at the core of what we do.</p>",
        "background": "",
